Strumprint Studio
Released into the public domain under the Unlicense (see LICENSE).

The app bundles no third-party code. It loads these fonts from Google Fonts at runtime:
- Rubik Moonrocks, SIL Open Font License 1.1
- Jost, SIL Open Font License 1.1

It uses Futura only if it is already installed on the viewer's computer; Futura is not included.

Pitch detection uses the McLeod Pitch Method (McLeod & Wyvill, 2005), implemented from the published algorithm.
Key guessing uses the Krumhansl-Schmuckler key profiles.
